      {
        "text": "After his fight with Li Hao, Fang Yuan has twenty-nine victories and needs one more to enter fourth inner city. He already has steel tendon Gu to raise his beast phantom count, but that process takes two to three months, and he expects harder pressure once he rises. Just as he considers who to borrow from, Bai Zhan Lie blocks his path and calls him Gu Yue Fang Zheng.",
